{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261029%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E4%BA%94%E7%B4%9A%E7%81%AB%EF%BD%9C%E7%89%B9%E9%A6%96%E7%8E%87%E7%9B%B8%E9%97%9C%E5%AE%98%E5%93%A1%E9%96%8B%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E6%9C%83-%E5%82%B3%E5%AA%92%E9%A0%88%E5%BE%85%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E5%AE%98%E5%93%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%A0%B4%E7%99%BC%E8%A8%80%E5%AE%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%AF%E5%85%AC%E9%96%8B%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>宏福苑火災獨立委員會今年3月舉行了30場聽證會，上周四向特首提交報告，事隔一周，政府今（29日）12時45分，宣布將於2時45分在政府總部地下演講廳舉行記者會，傳媒可於1時45分到場預覽報告，但必須待所有官員在記者會上的開場發言完畢，方可發放報告內容。<a href=\"https://bit.ly/41liVdz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【宏福苑火災獨立委員會報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>政府上周四的新聞公報指，行政長官李家超已收到相關報告，並感謝獨委會主席陸啟康和委員陳健波及歐陽伯權的努力。公報引述特首李家超指，將仔細研究報告，積極跟進獨委會的建議，會在短期內公布全面改革計劃和如何追究責任。</p>\n<p>政府表示，將會公開委員會報告，「由於與宏福苑大火有關的涉案人士已被刑事起訴，政府有責任考慮如何處理報告中可能涉及刑事審訊的部分，以免影響審訊，因此會徵詢法律意見，如何以適當方式盡快公開報告」。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://bit.ly/41liVdz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【宏福苑火災獨立委員會報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:31.168427+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:06:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.281766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.869328+00:00","content_hash":"cd3ac9e56f2b5ac3bd077c184be3540343b5ffd82e154e86e8cd4112c2a24542","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}